<title>USA: Glaxo migraine self-injector on sale in US.</title>
<headline>Glaxo migraine self-injector on sale in US.</headline>
<dateline>RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glaxo Wellcome Inc, a division of Glaxo Wellcome Plc, said Wednesday that its injector unit for self-administration of Imitrex Injection for the treatment of migraine is now available in the U.S. by prescription.</p>
</text>
